A POM's parent whose version would leave the repository names no file.
--- module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
dependencies:
  - org.example:lib:1.0
--- m2/org/example/lib/1.0/lib-1.0.pom
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0">
  <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>
  <parent><groupId>org.example</groupId><artifactId>parent</artifactId><version>..</version></parent>
  <artifactId>lib</artifactId>
  <version>1.0</version>
</project>
--- m2/org/example/lib/1.0/lib-1.0.jar
--- krusty-refusal
error	ERROR: org.example:parent:.. names no file in a Maven repository: its version `..` is not a file name
